      "html": "<ul class=\"d2u-list\"><li><strong>Camera & Exposure</strong><br>Master aperture, shutter, ISO, and how they shape an image.</li><li><strong>Lighting</strong><br>Natural light, strobes, and continuous lighting setups.</li><li><strong>Composition</strong><br>Framing, lines, and storytelling that elevates every shot.</li><li><strong>Post-Processing</strong><br>Lightroom and Photoshop workflows from cull to export.</li><li><strong>Portfolio + Client Work</strong><br>Shoot portraits, events, and commercial pieces ready to publish.</li></ul>"
